{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-19","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与比例与角","englishTitle":"The rectangle contained by rational straight lines commensurable in length is rational.","book":10,"number":19,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":19,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","contentId":"euclid-10-19","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a7268484fb0f50fbd6bb55102b36bec918a1ee5fa1e924b58b952efa60eeaec","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-19.statement","euclid-10-19.construction.1","euclid-10-19.proof.1","euclid-10-19.proof.2","euclid-10-19.proof.3","euclid-10-19.proof.4","euclid-10-19.proof.5","euclid-10-19.conclusion","euclid-10-19.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-19.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0e3c12c8a1ad0940c42c21ae01c4c9e17973ec388cf968978171bf41c41385b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The rectangle contained by rational straight lines commensurable in length is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形由有理线段、长度可公度组成,为有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"baa910c82eee34a31bed1e0f538190e39bb32634939e55357418fe6be13cc189","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the rectangle AC be contained by the rational straight lines AB, BC commensurable in length; I say that AC is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把矩形 AC船由有理线段 AB、BC 长度可公度组成;我说,AC是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25426ceeecce1019204c77357084ab1a8229778a2cb6e0360e9ed32027363e52","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For on AB let the square AD be described; therefore AD is rational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,请说明正方形 AD,因此AD是有理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"60a0f961826831ec50f3a511f8de6ced98c12f9920eaa89068a9221c2c7c4110","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is commensurable in length with BC, while AB is equal to BD, therefore BD is commensurable in length with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是长度可公度,BC,AB等于BD,BD是长度可公度,BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d0c2670ba662e4378d11b64b4047a64f495a394fb03cdb20723aa898bd527974","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as BD is to BC, so is DA to AC. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD比BC等于DA比AC；BD 与 BC 之比等于 DA 与 AC 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a22994986b896b70c054d1985fd4b29933d6862b72433065355a12a42522a87","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DA is commensurable with AC. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DA是可公度和AC。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"64d6d5bdcccb94697176ea13926f5d24153bb6bdffc8a445b872aa045b5e53c5","citations":["euclid-10-def-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DA is rational; therefore AC is also rational. [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DA是有理,因此AC也是有理。 [[X. Def. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-19.source","contentId":"euclid-10-19","revisionId":"euclid-10-19@raw-3a7268484fb0f50f","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9946aeaa2f46a2f21801b2ec47a2290c531749ae3a62e600b4ce26c021aa829","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-19:euclid-10-def-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-19.proof.1","euclid-10-19.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19/","sourceLabel":"X. Def. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-19:euclid-6-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-19.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.19/","sourceLabel":"VI. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-19:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-19","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-19.pr